§ `Tests of ss 76 to 81`

§§ `s 76(1): the duty to register`
-- args: presented for transfer; endorsed by an appropriate person; reasonable assurance; has a duty to inquire; has discharged any such duty; tax law complied with; transfer is rightful; transfer is to a bona fide purchaser; any fee has been paid
-- all six conditions met, with no duty to inquire
#ASSERT `the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
-- a duty to inquire that has been discharged
#ASSERT `the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
-- a duty to inquire that has not been discharged
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- the transfer is not rightful but is to a bona fide purchaser
#ASSERT `the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE
-- the transfer is neither rightful nor to a bona fide purchaser
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- presented not met
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- endorsed not met
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- assurance not met
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- tax not met
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- fee not met
#ASSERT NOT (`the issuer must register the transfer within s 76(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)

